; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Cherokee / ᏣᎳᎩ (chr)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

ᎦᏅᏍᏙᏗ counter 5

launch_loop:
ᎠᏂᏏᏍᏗ_ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ counter
ᎠᏓᏅᏖᏗ counter 1
ᎠᏟᎶᏍᏗ counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
ᎦᏅᏍᏙᏗ box 999
ᎠᏂᏏᏍᏗ_ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ box
